Two-layer focus alpha convention (dcsvr_two_layers_alpha, with dcsvr_two_layers; native/quadviews/dcsvr_twolayer_ps.hlsl,
dcsvrEdge.z): 0 (default, missing key) the focus layer as 0017 submits it, encoded colour not premultiplied in an
R8G8B8A8_UNORM swapchain, flags BLEND_TEXTURE_SOURCE_ALPHA | UNPREMULTIPLIED_ALPHA; 1 the colour premultiplied by the
fade on the encoded values, flags BLEND_TEXTURE_SOURCE_ALPHA alone (the OpenXR default convention); 2 the same bytes
in an R8G8B8A8_UNORM_SRGB swapchain. Read at start only (it picks the swapchain format), one log line when the key is
read. With 0 the submission and every output byte are as before (tests/quadviews-composition).
